{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a regular farming sim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of clicking through UI and pressing buttons to do chores, you type to bring your cozy life to life. Gather, fish, cook, run your restaurant, make friends\u2014everything runs on typing. The steady rhythm of your keystrokes pulls you into flow before you even notice, and suddenly time just\u2026 disappears. All that\u2019s left is calm and that satisfying sense of progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/f78c4af0bd7fd579520ac584f5902680.poster.avif?t=1770483445\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/f78c4af0bd7fd579520ac584f5902680.webm?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/f78c4af0bd7fd579520ac584f5902680.mp4?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restaurant Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own cozy little restaurant. Gather, farm, and fish to collect fresh ingredients, then cook hearty dishes for the townsfolk and share moments of happiness with them. Use wood and ore to keep upgrading your restaurant, unlocking deeper management options and expanding your menu with more creative recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/bbd99867130e3dabaa96ca4036f34c9c.poster.avif?t=1770483445\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/bbd99867130e3dabaa96ca4036f34c9c.webm?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/bbd99867130e3dabaa96ca4036f34c9c.mp4?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Town Companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of quirky neighbors and travelers, each with their own story to tell. Become their friend, lend a hand, and warm their hearts with homemade meals. helping them open up, heal, and chase the dreams they\u2019ve been holding onto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/623cc168574bd166f95c9909b5c7929c.poster.avif?t=1770483445\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/623cc168574bd166f95c9909b5c7929c.webm?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/623cc168574bd166f95c9909b5c7929c.mp4?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Homestead Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tend your vegetable plots and orchard, expand your fish pond and barn, and watch your homestead slowly grow into the cozy countryside retreat you\u2019ve always wanted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/3ec67ff873893d4476ae2ebbc4668376.poster.avif?t=1770483445\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/3ec67ff873893d4476ae2ebbc4668376.webm?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/3ec67ff873893d4476ae2ebbc4668376.mp4?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town and its surroundings are full of mysterious places waiting to be discovered. Uncover hidden wonders, collect rare finds, and help reshape the village\u2014but that\u2019s not all. Bring the stories and history you encounter back to the museum, turning your journey into exhibits and records so more people can come to know this warm, welcoming land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/269c6751aead078ea326c554ed6e4009.poster.avif?t=1770483445\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/269c6751aead078ea326c554ed6e4009.webm?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/269c6751aead078ea326c554ed6e4009.mp4?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Typing &amp; Language Learning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From letters and words to full sentences and passages, the game offers a wide range of typing and language exercises. It supports multiple UI languages and typing languages\u2014and you can switch them independently. As you play at your own pace, you\u2019ll naturally improve your typing speed and language skills without even noticing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/5102693cf3251d50dddf606f129e5a75.poster.avif?t=1770483445\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/5102693cf3251d50dddf606f129e5a75.webm?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/5102693cf3251d50dddf606f129e5a75.mp4?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Story: Uncover your grandfather\u2019s mysterious final wish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship System: Grow closer with the townsfolk to unlock new stories and features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded Areas: Explore the forest, the mines, and nearby islands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal Festivals: Take part in special events like the Fishing Festival, Halloween, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community to chat with us and help make the game even better. Your feedback means a lot to us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the community link on the right side of the store page to join.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3335690?t=1770483445","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3335690?t=1770483445","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/74bb9782fe5d00401fbc704ddd2b127d7d457259/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770483445","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/74bb9782fe5d00401fbc704ddd2b127d7d457259/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770483445","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4369880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a regular farming sim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of clicking through UI and pressing buttons to do chores, you type to bring your cozy life to life. Gather, fish, cook, run your restaurant, make friends\u2014everything runs on typing. The steady rhythm of your keystrokes pulls you into flow before you even notice, and suddenly time just\u2026 disappears. All that\u2019s left is calm and that satisfying sense of progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/f78c4af0bd7fd579520ac584f5902680.poster.avif?t=1770483445\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/f78c4af0bd7fd579520ac584f5902680.webm?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/f78c4af0bd7fd579520ac584f5902680.mp4?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restaurant Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own cozy little restaurant. Gather, farm, and fish to collect fresh ingredients, then cook hearty dishes for the townsfolk and share moments of happiness with them. Use wood and ore to keep upgrading your restaurant, unlocking deeper management options and expanding your menu with more creative recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/bbd99867130e3dabaa96ca4036f34c9c.poster.avif?t=1770483445\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/bbd99867130e3dabaa96ca4036f34c9c.webm?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/bbd99867130e3dabaa96ca4036f34c9c.mp4?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Town Companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of quirky neighbors and travelers, each with their own story to tell. Become their friend, lend a hand, and warm their hearts with homemade meals. helping them open up, heal, and chase the dreams they\u2019ve been holding onto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/623cc168574bd166f95c9909b5c7929c.poster.avif?t=1770483445\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/623cc168574bd166f95c9909b5c7929c.webm?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/623cc168574bd166f95c9909b5c7929c.mp4?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Homestead Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tend your vegetable plots and orchard, expand your fish pond and barn, and watch your homestead slowly grow into the cozy countryside retreat you\u2019ve always wanted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/3ec67ff873893d4476ae2ebbc4668376.poster.avif?t=1770483445\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/3ec67ff873893d4476ae2ebbc4668376.webm?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335690/extras/3ec67ff873893d4476ae2ebbc4668376.mp4?t=1770483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video